# Minami Bento — environment.
# Copy to .env.local and fill in what you want. EVERYTHING here is OPTIONAL:
# the Bento home page (/) needs none of it — it reads ~/.claude/projects directly.
# Never commit the filled-in .env.local (it's git-ignored).

# ── Metrics API (powers the /dashboard cards) ────────────────────────────────
# Base URL of the self-hosted metrics collector (see server/README.md). Leave blank
# to run without cross-machine metrics — the metrics cards just show "no source".
# NEXT_PUBLIC_* is exposed to the browser; the read key is obscurity only, so gate
# the deploy (password / auth) if you need real privacy.
NEXT_PUBLIC_METRICS_URL=
NEXT_PUBLIC_METRICS_KEY=

# ── Pluggable side panels (/dashboard: Task log / People / Trace-back / Analytics)
# Absolute path to a JSON file that backs those cards. See panels.example.json for
# the shape. Leave blank and the cards are simply empty (no personal data shipped).
MINAMI_PANELS_FILE=
